      "description": "<p>When the Corrosive Slime moves, it leaves a trail of bubbling slime in its wake. After moving, all squares the Corrosive Slime moves from or through count as Difficult Terrain until the end of the corrosive slime's next turn. Creatures which end their turn in one of those squares must succeed at a DC 20 basic Reflex save or take <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">2d8</span> acid damage.</p>",
